                  "text": "column 2: n-dodecane | column 3: 4.5 | column 4: 0.5 - 5.0 | column 5: 0.21 | column 6: 0.79 | column 9: MST_2024_Kavg | column 10: https://doi.org/10.1007/s12217-024-10115-x | column 11: Fig. 4"
