              "summary": "Numerical n-heptane studies with helium exchange at elevated pressure predict hot, warm and cool burning stages. The presentation compares those predictions qualitatively with n-dodecane FLEX-1268 observations at 2.75 atm. The associated CSV combines experimental histories and simulations. Rounded composition in the data index differs from the precise FLEX composition reported on the slide; these are preserved separately.",
