                  "locator": "page 10",
                  "text": "10 High Pressure Helium Exchange – 3 atm Evolution of radiative loss (n-heptane, do = 4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance N2, 3 atm). Evolution of diffusive loss (n-heptane, do = 4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance N2, 3 atm). • A strong coupling between heat generation and losses in the system. • The radiative and diffusive heat losses are comparable in the first and second stage. • The diffusive losses become prominent in the third stage “Cool flame” burn."
